    "media:imagetext": "Want to go to San Francisco\nBut don't want to goto L.A.?\nHERE'S HOW\non Western Airlines\n1. Non-Stop from Long Beach\nat 8:06 a.m.\n2. Non-Stop from Ontario at\n8:00 a.m. and 5:49 p.m.\nSave this for reference\nCall JE 4-0881\nor your Travel Agent\nGOING PLACES\nPropelled by 15,000 horsepower harnessed in four sleek\nnacelles, a Western Air Lines Electra jet sails through\nthe skies at more than 400 mph in quiet, effortless flight\nWith performance capabilities uniquely suited to airline\nnetworks, the Electra jet operates from runways as shori\nas 4,700 feet and is custom-tailored for high-frequency\nroutes from 150 to 2,500 miles long.\nCourtesy of Western Air Lines\nS-28547-B\nDexter Repro Rights\nGenuine Natural Color Made by DEXTER PRESS, Inc., West Nyack, N. Y\nPLACE\nS\nANGE\nJU 27630\nSTAMP\nL.S.POSRAG\n= 04\nPOSTCARD\nSommer Institute of Linguisti\nP.O. Box 1960\nSanta Ana, Calif.\n015,1661735",
